  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2025 Syria Regional Appeal - Lebanon - Shelter and non-food items</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As needed, UNRWA will continue supporting displaced populations in its DESs across Lebanon through a comprehensive shelter management system that ensures safety, upholds service standards, and addresses evolving needs. The Agency will provide emergency cash assistance of US$ 300 per household, per month for six months to 30,000 PRS and PRL households who have lost access to safe housing due to the conflict, including those in formal and informal shelters or hosted in overcrowded homes. Additionally, to help vulnerable families withstand harsh conditions in the coldest regions, specialized winterization cash assistance will be provided to 6,000 climate-vulnerable PRL and PRS families.</narrative>
  </description>
